---
layout: base.njk
title: "Privacy Policy | Heroes and Heritage Tours"
description: "How Heroes and Heritage Tours collects, uses and protects your personal information."
activeNav: privacy
permalink: "/privacy.html"
---

<section class="section" style="padding-top: 160px;">
  <div class="container container--text">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1 style="margin-top: var(--space-2); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mono-label" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-5);">Last updated: {{ privacy.lastUpdated }}</p>

    <div class="stack" style="gap: var(--space-3);">
      {% for p in privacy.paragraphs %}
      <p class="body-text">{{ p | md | safe }}</p>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="cta-band" style="margin-top: var(--space-7);">
      <h2>Questions about your data?</h2>
      <p class="lede">Contact us and we'll be happy to help.</p>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
